{"availability":"available","full":"lucasdaddiego/peso","name":"peso","description":"What is X pesos from year Y worth today? Argentine inflation and peso purchasing power from real INDEC + BCRA data: a spliced CPI (IPC San Luis for the 2007-2015 INDEC-intervention years) plus official vs blue dollar. Reproducible Python pipeline + static TypeScript / Observable Plot app.","category":"Developer tools","language":"Python","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-06-28T21:52:42Z","updated":"2026-10-11T03:55:05Z","license":"MIT","branch":"master","homepage":"https://peso.daddiego.com.ar","topics":["argentina","bcra","cloudflare-pages","cpi","data-pipeline","data-visualization","datos-gob-ar","dolar-blue","economics","exchange-rates","indec","inflacion","inflation","observable-plot","open-data","peso","purchasing-power","python","typescript","vite"],"demo":"https://peso.daddiego.com.ar/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-13T06:37:26.549Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-13T06:37:26.549Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-13T06:37:26.549Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-07T18:43:20.069Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-09T19:33:55.205Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-13T06:37:26.549Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["[](pyproject.toml) [](web/tsconfig.json) [](web/package.json) [](","What is X pesos from year Y worth today? This tool answers it from real INDEC and BCRA data — it downloads the official consumer-price and exchange-rate series, splices them into one continuous monthly index, and converts any past peso amount into today's purchasing power, plus its value in dollars at the official and blue (informal) rates. No eyeballed inflation, no single broken series across the years the INDEC was intervened.","Validated to the official figures. The spliced index reproduces INDEC's published Dec–Dec inflation for 2017–2025 to the decimal (24.8 · 47.6 · 53.8 · 36.1 · 50.9 · 94.8 · 211.4 · 117.8 · 31.5 %), the IPC-GBA 2002 collapse (40.9 %), and 1:1 convertibility FX — plus a pinned cumulative cross-check that $1.000 of January 2003 ≈ $1.65M today."],"features":["pipeline/ — an offline, reproducible Python pipeline (uv, standard-library only) that fetches the","web/ — a static Vite + TypeScript site that reads that JSON and renders honest graphics"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/lucasdaddiego/peso/blob/master/README.md","fingerprint":"8e90df980cb58cbbe7592287ff6ba849e0f1507a5dfe09b4b6edb3eba10872a0","extractedAt":"2026-10-07T18:43:20.168Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-07T18:43:20.168Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"[](pyproject.toml) [](web/tsconfig.json) [](web/package.json) [](","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/lucasdaddiego/peso/blob/master/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"8e90df980cb58cbbe7592287ff6ba849e0f1507a5dfe09b4b6edb3eba10872a0","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/lucasdaddiego/peso/blob/master/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-07T18:43:20.168Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-07T14:17:59Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/lucasdaddiego/peso/blob/master/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-07T18:43:20.169Z","hash":"8e90df980cb58cbbe7592287ff6ba849e0f1507a5dfe09b4b6edb3eba10872a0","originalBytes":11698,"storedBytes":11698,"truncated":false},"lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-07T18:43:20.069Z","subjects":["Data & dashboards"],"platforms":[],"classification":{"version":4,"method":"local_rules","category":"Developer tools","subjects":["Data & dashboards"],"evidence":[{"subject":"Data & dashboards","source":"metadata","match":"data visualization"}],"platformEvidence":[],"platformSupport":"author_metadata_not_runtime_tested","suggestedSubjects":["Automation & workflows"],"reviewRequired":true},"demoHealth":{"url":"https://peso.daddiego.com.ar/","attemptedAt":"2026-10-14T14:45:06.672Z","probeVersion":3,"status":"working","checkedAt":"2026-10-14T14:45:06.672Z","lastWorking